# Project Requirements & Architecture

## User Stories

* As a **Security Analyst**, I want to **register new IT hardware and software assets into the system**, so I can **maintain a complete inventory of organization-wide endpoints.**
  * **Acceptance Criteria:**
    * The asset creation form requires hostname, IP address, operating system version, and department ownership.
    * Newly added assets immediately appear in the main dashboard inventory list.

* As a **Vulnerability Manager**, I want to **associate CVE records and CVSS risk scores to specific software assets**, so I can **quantify exact exposure levels across the network.**
  * **Acceptance Criteria:**
    * The system validates CVE ID formats.
    * Entering a CVSS score automatically categorizes the risk level into Low, Medium, High, or Critical.

## Mis-User Stories & Mitigation Criteria

* As a **malicious unauthenticated actor**, I want to **inject arbitrary SQL payloads into the global asset search bar**, so I can **extract sensitive database tables.**
  * **Mitigation Criteria:**
    * All database queries must utilize Django ORM parameterized statements to entirely neutralize raw SQL injection vectors.

